# Installed by deploy/deploy.sh on every deploy (rsync + daemon-reload).
# Warms the RIS↔ME map of the current GP: ~46 upstream requests that must
# not land on a visitor (docs/ris-join.md §4a). Started by the timer nightly
# and by deploy.sh after each restart, because the Nitro cache is in-memory.
#
# Second call since 2026-09-17: the homepage now also states what is in
# Begutachtung WITHOUT a Gegenstand at Parliament (docs/architecture.md
# §12.16). It reads the same corpus the first call warms, so it adds no
# upstream traffic — but it has its own 30-minute derived cache, and that
# section is a correction to a claim the page makes, so it must not be the
# one part of the start page that arrives cold. (Its path followed the
# rename to /api/ris-drafts on 2026-09-18 — §12.19.)
#
# Third call since 2026-09-18: the station map behind the station filter
# (§12.26). This is the expensive one — 227 upstream requests for GP XXVIII,
# 650 for XXVII, 35.6 s cold — and the only one that MUST run here: the list
# reads the map under a 2.5 s budget and simply answers without stations when
# it is cold, so a map nobody warms is a filter nobody sees. --max-time 900
# rather than 600 because the timer may fire on a period twice that size.
#
# Fourth call since 2026-09-19: the Bundesgesetzblatt Teil II volumes the
# Verordnung pages read their Kundmachung from (§12.32). Three volumes are
# about 21 requests to RIS when cold — and unlike the other sections, the
# result of a cold run would not merely be slow but a statement: whoever does
# not have the volumes finds no Kundmachung and would write „nicht
# kundgemacht" under a Verordnung that has been in force for a long time.
#
# It stands BEFORE the list call, ever since the list shows the outcome per
# row (§12.32): the list waits only 3 s for it and otherwise renders without
# the column — which is right, but avoidable when the volumes are already in.
[Unit]
Description=Begutachtungs-Monitor: warm the RIS↔ME map of the current GP
After=begutachtungs-monitor.service
Requires=begutachtungs-monitor.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/bin/curl -fsS -o /dev/null --max-time 600 http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/ris-map/aktuell
ExecStart=/usr/bin/curl -fsS -o /dev/null --max-time 300 http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/bgbl/teil2
ExecStart=/usr/bin/curl -fsS -o /dev/null --max-time 120 "http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/ris-drafts?status=open"
ExecStart=/usr/bin/curl -fsS -o /dev/null --max-time 900 http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/stations/aktuell
